WEBVTT

01:26.420 --> 01:29.750
[Glory]

01:30.720 --> 01:32.990
[Episode 24]

01:38.200 --> 01:39.759
I'm a member of the Rong family.

01:39.759 --> 01:41.680
I can't believe
you want me to be your spy.

01:41.680 --> 01:42.410
Yang Yitang,

01:42.590 --> 01:43.920
have you lost your mind?

01:44.430 --> 01:45.160
Lady Yunshu,

01:45.560 --> 01:47.039
you offered advice to me

01:47.039 --> 01:49.000
and instructed me
to expose Madam Yang as an impostor.

01:49.000 --> 01:51.060
Have you been doing this for charity?

01:51.280 --> 01:52.680
You're just
trying to incite Old Madam Rong

01:52.680 --> 01:53.920
to detest Lady Shanbao

01:53.920 --> 01:55.580
so that she will be driven out.

01:55.710 --> 01:57.440
But even without Rong Shanbao,

01:57.680 --> 01:59.740
the Rong family still won't be yours.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.120
Don't forget that

02:01.380 --> 02:01.870
you still have

02:01.870 --> 02:03.480
a shrewd sister, Yunxi.

02:03.920 --> 02:05.680
Though she's not as favored as you,

02:05.680 --> 02:07.000
her reputation in the tea business

02:07.000 --> 02:08.120
far exceeds yours.

02:08.310 --> 02:10.360
Besides, will Old Madam Rong

02:10.360 --> 02:13.090
really pass the Rong family's business
onto you?

02:13.310 --> 02:14.080
That old fox

02:14.080 --> 02:15.030
is just using you to suppress

02:15.030 --> 02:16.490
Rong Shanbao's prestige.

02:16.520 --> 02:17.430
If you truly regard

02:17.430 --> 02:19.680
Old Madam's flattery as genuine favor,

02:19.870 --> 02:21.750
then you're really a fool.

02:22.310 --> 02:24.710
We used to
have a mutually beneficial relationship.

02:24.710 --> 02:25.840
If I help you now,

02:26.190 --> 02:27.590
what benefits will I get?

02:28.750 --> 02:30.630
I've heard that the vast wealth
accumulated by

02:30.630 --> 02:32.190
several generations of the Rong family

02:32.190 --> 02:34.280
is stored
in the Rong family's private treasury.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.960
With your share
of this substantial family property,

02:35.960 --> 02:37.630
you can establish your own business.

02:37.630 --> 02:38.630
Then you will no longer have to

02:38.630 --> 02:39.560
stay by Old Madam's side

02:39.560 --> 02:40.840
to serve her.

02:41.240 --> 02:42.970
If I make my grandmother happy,

02:43.120 --> 02:45.360
how would you know
I can't get the family property?

02:45.360 --> 02:47.020
Why do I have to take such risks

02:47.079 --> 02:48.470
and attract thieves from outside?

02:48.470 --> 02:49.930
If you refuse to be my ally,

02:50.100 --> 02:52.120
then you'll be considered as my enemy.

02:52.120 --> 02:53.680
Unless you want Old Madam

02:53.680 --> 02:55.310
to see through your ambitions.

02:55.310 --> 02:56.430
So what even if she sees through

02:56.430 --> 02:57.310
my ambitions?

02:57.870 --> 02:59.630
The Rong family's members
admire talented people

02:59.630 --> 03:02.490
and have always
let the most capable one be the head.

03:04.360 --> 03:05.520
Lady Yunshu, you really know

03:05.520 --> 03:06.920
how to deceive yourself.

03:07.000 --> 03:08.360
You clearly know that

03:08.590 --> 03:09.710
all the younger members of the Rong family

03:09.710 --> 03:11.840
are just whetstones for Rong Shanbao.

03:11.870 --> 03:12.870
No matter how hard a stone is,

03:12.870 --> 03:14.730
it can never compare with a knife,

03:15.190 --> 03:17.400
let alone replacing it.

03:21.030 --> 03:21.910
My Lady,

03:22.470 --> 03:25.200
why don't we just report this
to the authorities?

03:25.280 --> 03:27.240
If someone puts a knife on my neck,

03:29.120 --> 03:30.850
then let's just take a good look

03:32.000 --> 03:33.590
to see who might be injured

03:34.520 --> 03:35.480
by this knife.

03:37.280 --> 03:39.710
[Rong Mansion]

04:20.000 --> 04:20.680
Old Madam!

04:21.160 --> 04:21.820
Outside...

04:23.390 --> 04:24.320
Who are you guys?

04:24.510 --> 04:26.000
How dare you break into my place?

04:26.000 --> 04:26.600
Tell me!

04:27.160 --> 04:29.760
Where is the key
to the Rong family's treasury?

04:31.630 --> 04:32.430
Grandmother.

04:33.560 --> 04:34.430
What key?

04:35.070 --> 04:35.870
I don't know.

04:36.720 --> 04:38.680
Tell me! Where on earth is the key?

04:40.000 --> 04:41.240
You wretched old hag!

04:41.950 --> 04:44.240
I'm afraid you can't survive
to spend the money you've been hoarding.

04:44.240 --> 04:45.630
If you still refuse to tell me,

04:45.630 --> 04:47.630
don't blame me for showing no mercy.

04:47.630 --> 04:49.690
I'll kill your granddaughter first.

04:52.920 --> 04:53.600
Yunshu!

04:54.510 --> 04:55.350
Yunshu!

04:57.000 --> 04:58.040
Who are you guys?

04:58.240 --> 04:58.830
Who is it?

05:00.000 --> 05:00.510
Search!

05:01.830 --> 05:02.360
You...

05:03.310 --> 05:05.170
Take all the valuable stuff away.

05:10.430 --> 05:10.950
Yunshu!

05:12.040 --> 05:12.830
Yunshu!

05:14.500 --> 05:15.740
My Lord, bad news!

05:17.000 --> 05:18.270
I'm perfectly fine.

05:18.720 --> 05:19.580
What happened?

05:19.680 --> 05:20.360
Why are you so flustered?

05:20.360 --> 05:21.800
The Rong Mansion was robbed by bandits,

05:21.800 --> 05:23.720
and a young lady from the Rong family
is seriously injured.

05:23.720 --> 05:26.120
Which young lady
from the Rong family is it?

05:26.560 --> 05:27.510
It's not Lady Shanbao.

05:27.510 --> 05:28.770
It's Lady Rong Yunshu.

05:28.830 --> 05:29.560
Lady Yunshu.

05:31.750 --> 05:33.750
Let's go. Gather everyone here.

05:34.190 --> 05:36.650
I need to
visit the Rong Mansion personally.

05:59.040 --> 06:00.120
You're finally here.

06:00.120 --> 06:02.180
How did you know I would come, Mr. Yan?

06:03.120 --> 06:04.190
The Rong family
is a prominent clan in Linji.

06:04.190 --> 06:06.120
A midnight robbery
must be no small matter.

06:06.120 --> 06:06.750
I reckoned you would certainly

06:06.750 --> 06:07.780
come here to investigate it personally,

06:07.780 --> 06:09.110
so I waited here for you.

06:09.920 --> 06:10.510
What exactly is the matter

06:10.510 --> 06:11.750
that has bothered you so much?

06:11.750 --> 06:12.920
Something serious has happened inside.

06:12.920 --> 06:14.120
Come with me quickly.

06:18.500 --> 06:20.230
Repeat what you've just told me

06:20.250 --> 06:21.700
-to her.
-Step aside!

06:23.600 --> 06:24.360
Old Madam.

06:24.800 --> 06:25.720
Those bandits

06:26.270 --> 06:27.720
all came out from the Hualin Courtyard's

06:27.720 --> 06:28.360
tunnel.

06:29.040 --> 06:31.240
They were heading straight
for the Chongxi Hall

06:31.240 --> 06:33.680
without alerting the guards
in the outer courtyard.

06:33.680 --> 06:35.480
And the guard rotation schedule

06:35.510 --> 06:36.970
changes every two months.

06:37.390 --> 06:38.050
It's all...

06:38.440 --> 06:39.540
It's all personally arranged by you,

06:39.540 --> 06:40.750
Rong Shanbao.

06:41.560 --> 06:42.490
Grandmother...

06:42.870 --> 06:43.360
I...

06:52.120 --> 06:52.780
Step aside!

06:53.430 --> 06:55.090
I'm telling you to step aside!

06:55.260 --> 06:56.120
Step aside!

07:01.870 --> 07:03.000
Old Madam, in a rage,

07:03.480 --> 07:04.360
you concluded that Lady Shanbao

07:04.360 --> 07:05.800
was the culprit
after hearing just a few words.

07:05.800 --> 07:07.330
Wasn't that a bit too hasty?

07:07.830 --> 07:09.120
If she had truly betrayed the Rong family,

07:09.120 --> 07:09.800
why would she reveal

07:09.800 --> 07:11.120
the tunnel in the Hualin Courtyard?

07:11.120 --> 07:12.720
That would only
bring trouble upon herself.

07:12.720 --> 07:13.390
Old Madam,

07:13.950 --> 07:15.630
Lady Shanbao heard that something happened
down the mountain.

07:15.630 --> 07:16.950
Then she rushed back
to the Rong Mansion overnight.

07:16.950 --> 07:18.840
She was worried about your safety.

07:18.840 --> 07:20.510
Without distinguishing right from wrong,
you just hit her.

07:20.510 --> 07:22.040
It's truly disheartening.

07:22.750 --> 07:25.150
Why are you out
with such serious injuries?

07:25.720 --> 07:26.360
Yunshu!

07:26.690 --> 07:27.490
Grandmother.

07:27.510 --> 07:28.190
Yunshu.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.270
-Grandmother.
-You...

07:29.270 --> 07:31.330
I don't think Shanbao is the culprit.

07:32.360 --> 07:35.090
Shanbao
has dedicated herself to the Rong family

07:35.360 --> 07:37.760
and shown complete filial devotion to you.

07:38.000 --> 07:39.860
The Rong family is her whole world

07:40.070 --> 07:41.540
and even her only home.

07:42.240 --> 07:43.070
She would never

07:43.070 --> 07:44.930
collude with outsiders to rob our mansion.

07:44.930 --> 07:47.730
Grandmother, there must be a mistake.

07:48.510 --> 07:51.570
Someone else
must be the accomplice inside this house.

07:51.600 --> 07:53.130
I don't think it's Shanbao.

07:53.430 --> 07:55.290
Now that you're so badly injured,

07:55.510 --> 07:57.110
you're still defending her.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.270
I brought her up.

08:00.190 --> 08:02.050
Speaking of how ambitious she is,

08:02.300 --> 08:04.030
no one knows it better than I do.

08:04.390 --> 08:06.630
Precisely because she thinks of
the Rong family as everything,

08:06.630 --> 08:08.760
losing it would be unbearable for her.

08:08.950 --> 08:11.280
A person who has never experienced defeat

08:11.390 --> 08:13.120
simply cannot accept failure!

08:14.070 --> 08:15.000
Rong Shanbao.

08:15.800 --> 08:16.920
As you resented me

08:17.390 --> 08:19.720
for stripping you of the authority
to run the household,

08:19.720 --> 08:22.650
you incited those bandits
to break into our mansion.

08:33.750 --> 08:35.390
The tunnel's existence
has long been revealed.

08:35.390 --> 08:36.789
As long as one was determined
to investigate it,

08:36.789 --> 08:39.120
the guard rotation schedule
wouldn't be a secret for him.

08:39.120 --> 08:40.669
None of these so-called pieces of evidence

08:40.669 --> 08:41.549
can prove

08:41.549 --> 08:43.549
that I've betrayed the Rong family.

08:43.669 --> 08:44.470
Grandmother.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.630
Others may suspect me.

08:47.440 --> 08:49.040
Even you don't trust me, huh?

08:49.720 --> 08:50.790
In your mind,

08:51.840 --> 08:52.550
is your own granddaughter,

08:52.550 --> 08:54.640
who you've carefully educated
for 20 years,

08:54.640 --> 08:55.510
such an ungrateful

08:55.510 --> 08:56.710
and disloyal person?

08:57.080 --> 08:57.940
If it's not you,

08:58.390 --> 09:00.000
who else would have such guts

09:00.790 --> 09:04.600
to betray the Rong family
by colluding with outsiders?

09:05.600 --> 09:06.550
Is it Yunxi,

09:07.270 --> 09:08.120
Xiangling

09:08.670 --> 09:09.550
or Yunshu?

09:10.720 --> 09:12.320
You're taking revenge on me.

09:12.750 --> 09:14.610
You want me to see with my own eyes,

09:15.550 --> 09:16.960
without you, how chaotic

09:16.960 --> 09:18.510
the Rong family would become.

09:18.510 --> 09:20.390
You're deliberately seeking revenge!

09:20.390 --> 09:22.320
Grandmother, I have never....

09:22.960 --> 09:24.860
and will never betray the Rong family.

09:24.860 --> 09:25.620
I won't!

09:36.200 --> 09:37.060
Old Madam Rong.

09:38.080 --> 09:40.080
A major robbery case happened in Linji.

09:40.080 --> 09:41.910
As the Prefect, it is my duty to solve it.

09:41.910 --> 09:43.290
I've dispatched men
to search the whole city

09:43.290 --> 09:45.550
so that we can capture the bandits
as soon as possible.

09:45.550 --> 09:47.030
Lady Shanbao is a woman of noble character

09:47.030 --> 09:48.670
and always acts with integrity.

09:48.670 --> 09:50.360
If she had wanted to compete
to run the Rong family's business,

09:50.360 --> 09:52.200
why would she risk irritating you

09:52.200 --> 09:52.960
by helping

09:52.960 --> 09:55.090
Madam Yang, who has no relation to her?

09:55.910 --> 09:58.270
A person
who truly has a strong desire for power

09:58.270 --> 10:00.000
would never sacrifice himself

10:00.030 --> 10:01.560
to help someone unrelated.

10:01.840 --> 10:04.320
Moreover, to speak frankly,

10:04.870 --> 10:06.720
if Lady Shanbao had wanted to take action,

10:06.720 --> 10:08.750
wouldn't it be more efficient
to eliminate the enemy completely?

10:08.750 --> 10:09.270
You...

10:09.910 --> 10:12.620
Old Madam,
please use your wisdom and discernment.

10:12.620 --> 10:14.950
Don't wrongly accuse an innocent person.

10:17.840 --> 10:20.550
Grandmother, I didn't do it.

10:22.720 --> 10:23.650
Please trust me.

10:32.480 --> 10:34.080
Yunshu! Yunshu! Yunshu!

10:34.510 --> 10:35.000
Yunshu!

10:36.480 --> 10:37.280
Grandmother!

10:38.000 --> 10:39.530
-Old Madam!
-Grandmother!

10:40.360 --> 10:41.160
Grandmother!

10:46.390 --> 10:48.120
-Grandmother!
-Grandmother!

10:51.480 --> 10:52.870
Haven't you irritated Grandmother enough?

10:52.870 --> 10:53.910
Do you want to irritate her

10:53.910 --> 10:54.440
to death?

10:56.360 --> 10:57.160
Grandmother!

11:00.630 --> 11:02.160
Go back and wait for my news.

11:02.870 --> 11:03.720
I promise you

11:04.200 --> 11:06.660
I'll definitely
arrest the culprit for you.

11:06.750 --> 11:09.210
The truth of the case
will be uncovered soon.

11:09.720 --> 11:10.780
Just go back first.

11:11.000 --> 11:12.030
If Old Madam sees you,

11:12.030 --> 11:13.440
she'll only be even angrier,

11:13.440 --> 11:14.870
which will make things worse instead.

11:14.870 --> 11:16.470
Don't worry. I'll stay here.

11:25.670 --> 11:27.670
Thank you for your concern, Lord Lu.

11:27.790 --> 11:30.120
I hope
you can arrest the real culprit soon

11:30.200 --> 11:31.200
and clear my name.

11:31.780 --> 11:32.330
Okay.

11:33.510 --> 11:34.370
Within 10 days,

11:35.870 --> 11:37.270
I will give you an answer.

11:47.120 --> 11:48.450
Send for the doctor now!

11:48.450 --> 11:49.750
Why are you standing there like a fool?

11:49.750 --> 11:51.610
Bring some hot water here. Go now!

11:51.910 --> 11:52.720
Yes!

11:56.720 --> 11:57.520
Lady Shanbao.

11:58.080 --> 11:59.120
You all may leave now.

11:59.120 --> 11:59.600
Yes.

12:05.910 --> 12:06.630
Mr. Bai.

12:07.550 --> 12:08.150
Could you

12:08.390 --> 12:10.250
let me talk to Yunshu for a moment?

12:32.870 --> 12:33.670
You're awake.

12:35.910 --> 12:37.320
It's just a minor injury.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.960
Grandmother was just angry today.

12:41.670 --> 12:43.870
Please don't take it to heart, Shanbao.

12:43.960 --> 12:45.760
When Grandmother feels better,

12:46.320 --> 12:47.320
I will definitely send someone

12:47.320 --> 12:48.850
to inform you immediately.

12:49.560 --> 12:53.290
Asking a tiger for its skin
might make yourself get bitten instead.

13:03.980 --> 13:05.110
Shanbao, do you know

13:05.150 --> 13:06.360
how many steps it takes

13:06.360 --> 13:08.020
to walk from your Qilan Garden

13:08.080 --> 13:09.880
to Grandmother's Chongxi Hall?

13:11.550 --> 13:13.080
I don't think you know that.

13:13.390 --> 13:14.150
After all, you've been

13:14.150 --> 13:15.150
pampered by everyone

13:15.150 --> 13:16.240
since childhood.

13:17.030 --> 13:19.430
How would you notice such trivial matters?

13:19.960 --> 13:21.420
What are you trying to say?

13:22.960 --> 13:25.750
From my courtyard to the Chongxi Hall,

13:26.720 --> 13:28.670
it takes exactly 728 steps.

13:30.870 --> 13:32.080
It took me 16 years

13:33.200 --> 13:34.530
to finish this journey.

13:36.080 --> 13:36.840
Shanbao.

13:37.550 --> 13:40.670
I wonder which of us

13:41.390 --> 13:43.360
could go farther in the future.

14:11.360 --> 14:13.840
Bai, I'm in so much pain.

14:17.500 --> 14:19.430
Now that just the two of us are here,

14:20.030 --> 14:21.960
you don't need to pretend anymore.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.670
I was watching coldly just now.

14:24.670 --> 14:25.600
In the Chongxi Hall,

14:25.600 --> 14:27.790
you tried so hard to defend Lady Shanbao,

14:27.790 --> 14:30.440
which made Old Madam Rong
get more suspicious instead.

14:30.440 --> 14:32.570
Did you really do that for her own good?

14:35.080 --> 14:35.740
Yunshu.

14:36.840 --> 14:38.750
Where did those bandits come from?

14:38.750 --> 14:40.680
Do you truly know nothing about it?

14:42.360 --> 14:44.760
You're the one who's framing Lady Shanbao.

14:47.560 --> 14:49.070
I am your fiancé.

14:49.790 --> 14:51.650
If you refuse to tell me the truth,

14:52.150 --> 14:54.010
then I can no longer cover for you.

14:54.510 --> 14:56.960
I have something else to tell Old Madam.

14:59.910 --> 15:00.600
Don't go!

15:09.480 --> 15:10.480
Do you want to die?

15:15.910 --> 15:18.670
I beg you! Please help me!

15:22.270 --> 15:23.080
I beg you!

16:09.200 --> 16:09.790
Alright.

16:11.600 --> 16:12.930
I'm not going anywhere.

16:13.670 --> 16:14.870
I'll stay right here.

16:15.630 --> 16:17.230
I'll just stay here with you.

16:28.010 --> 16:28.720
[Chongxi Hall]

16:40.870 --> 16:42.320
The ginseng tonic is ready.

16:42.320 --> 16:43.910
Let Old Madam have a cup of it first.

16:43.910 --> 16:45.630
Then let her have a second cup of it
after midnight.

16:45.630 --> 16:46.790
Only when Old Madam is awake

16:46.790 --> 16:48.450
can she have some rice congee.

16:58.360 --> 17:00.410
Dr. Sun, please forgive my intrusion.

17:00.410 --> 17:01.750
How is Old Madam's condition?

17:01.750 --> 17:03.360
Old Madam is over 60 years old.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.680
Last night, her anger affected her heart.

17:04.680 --> 17:05.750
Fortunately, a few days ago,

17:05.750 --> 17:07.640
she took medicine to prevent stroke,

17:07.640 --> 17:08.839
which saved her life.

17:09.589 --> 17:10.680
However, in the coming days,

17:10.680 --> 17:12.270
she still needs proper care and rest.

17:12.270 --> 17:14.270
She must not exhaust herself again.

17:16.680 --> 17:17.140
Please.

17:22.310 --> 17:23.569
Mr. Yan, didn't you...

17:26.270 --> 17:28.790
hear any movements
in the mansion last night?

17:28.790 --> 17:30.790
Xinfang Pavilion
is the farthest from Chongxi Hall,

17:30.790 --> 17:32.320
with a garden between them.

17:32.530 --> 17:32.960
Those bandits

17:32.960 --> 17:34.480
went through
the Hualin Courtyard's secret tunnel

17:34.480 --> 17:36.910
to avoid alerting the guards
in the mansion.

17:36.910 --> 17:37.780
If someone had not discovered

17:37.780 --> 17:39.920
the unconscious night watchman
in the bushes

17:39.920 --> 17:41.920
or summoned
the outer-courtyard guards in time,

17:41.920 --> 17:45.580
I'm afraid the entire Rong family
would have been in great danger.

17:45.720 --> 17:46.550
You're right.

17:47.720 --> 17:50.030
These bandits came and went
without leaving a trace.

17:50.030 --> 17:52.350
They headed straight for the Chongxi Hall.

17:52.350 --> 17:54.270
Someone inside the Rong Mansion
must have colluded with them.

17:54.270 --> 17:56.400
It couldn't possibly be Lady Shanbao.

17:56.640 --> 17:59.000
The Rong family
is the most important in her mind.

17:59.000 --> 18:00.750
Even if everyone else
betrayed the Rong family,

18:00.750 --> 18:01.680
she never would.

18:03.110 --> 18:03.880
That's true.

18:06.270 --> 18:09.670
We found the traces of bandits
at the foot of the tea mountain.

18:10.110 --> 18:10.970
What happened?

18:15.790 --> 18:16.350
My Lord.

18:16.350 --> 18:17.750
Holding the Governor's seal,
the garrison troops in Linji

18:17.750 --> 18:18.550
are using the pretext
of eliminating bandits

18:18.550 --> 18:19.640
to completely surround the tea mountain.

18:19.640 --> 18:22.170
Let's go!
We'll talk further on the mountain.

18:23.280 --> 18:23.810
Let's go!

18:44.830 --> 18:45.630
Wanwan, look.

18:46.920 --> 18:48.070
You must do it this way,

18:48.070 --> 18:49.750
flipping them up
with your thenar eminence.

18:49.750 --> 18:50.350
My Lady!

18:51.160 --> 18:53.420
In this way, you won't get burned easily.

18:53.750 --> 18:54.810
At a time like this,

18:54.830 --> 18:57.030
you still have the mood
to teach her how to pan-fry tea leaves?

18:57.030 --> 18:58.480
Rong Yunshu is even oppressing you now

18:58.480 --> 18:59.740
and abusing her power.

18:59.940 --> 19:01.330
If you're still my real sister,

19:01.330 --> 19:02.540
go back to the Rong Mansion right now

19:02.540 --> 19:04.120
and give her a good whipping.

19:04.120 --> 19:06.240
Let's see if she still dares to
disrespect her superiors again.

19:06.240 --> 19:07.640
Yunshu is badly injured.

19:08.160 --> 19:09.690
She can't survive if I whip her.

19:09.690 --> 19:11.110
It would be great if she dies.

19:11.110 --> 19:12.570
Yunxi told me everything.

19:13.030 --> 19:15.240
She pretended to be innocent
in front of Grandmother,

19:15.240 --> 19:17.110
which made you get into great trouble.

19:17.110 --> 19:17.680
Previously, I even thought

19:17.680 --> 19:19.210
she had a good disposition.

19:19.510 --> 19:20.130
It turns out that she's just

19:20.130 --> 19:22.390
a despicable woman in sheep’s clothing.

19:22.590 --> 19:23.440
The authority
of the eldest legitimate daughter

19:23.440 --> 19:24.590
from the First Branch of our Rong family

19:24.590 --> 19:26.590
isn't something she can challenge!

19:27.550 --> 19:29.350
Just see how I'll flay her alive!

19:34.310 --> 19:36.200
I'm not being indignant for your sake,

19:36.200 --> 19:37.600
but for our First Branch.

19:38.350 --> 19:40.200
No matter how close sisters are,

19:40.530 --> 19:42.730
there must still be a proper hierarchy.

19:42.830 --> 19:43.480
The great contributions you've made

19:43.480 --> 19:44.590
to the Rong family

19:44.750 --> 19:46.210
can't be erased by anyone.

19:46.400 --> 19:47.730
What's more, Mother...

19:48.750 --> 19:51.080
Mother planned it for you
for so many years

19:51.320 --> 19:53.440
that she didn't even close her eyes
when she died.

19:53.440 --> 19:55.840
You can't give up this honorable position.

19:56.750 --> 19:57.550
Wanwan, look.

19:58.360 --> 20:01.120
Only in this way
can you avoid getting burned.

20:03.110 --> 20:05.830
Rong Shanbao, did you hear that or not?

20:06.960 --> 20:07.760
Lady Shanbao!

20:08.480 --> 20:10.440
The soldiers
have surrounded the tea plantation!

20:10.440 --> 20:11.040
Soldiers?

20:11.270 --> 20:12.130
What soldiers?

20:12.310 --> 20:14.510
What are they doing on our tea mountain?

20:18.270 --> 20:20.270
Come on. Let's go out and take a look.

20:24.440 --> 20:25.900
Lady Yunwan! Lady Yunwan!

20:26.590 --> 20:28.390
I'll teach you. Let's continue.

20:29.170 --> 20:30.000
Step aside, you all!

20:30.000 --> 20:31.000
The government is handling a case!

20:31.000 --> 20:32.640
All irrelevant people
should get out of the way!

20:32.640 --> 20:33.770
Search thoroughly!

20:34.000 --> 20:35.790
Just find them even if you have to
turn the place upside down!

20:35.790 --> 20:37.350
This tea mountain is a den of bandits!

20:37.350 --> 20:38.400
If we can't find anything,

20:38.400 --> 20:39.690
you guys will be held accountable, too!

20:39.690 --> 20:40.650
Stop it now!

20:40.680 --> 20:41.750
Just stop it!

20:42.720 --> 20:44.050
What are you guys doing?

20:44.920 --> 20:45.450
Go there!

20:45.960 --> 20:48.090
Don't destroy this! Don't destroy it!

20:48.310 --> 20:49.890
This is all from everyone's hard work.

20:49.890 --> 20:51.120
You can't destroy it!

20:51.880 --> 20:53.880
It's all from everyone's hard work.

20:54.830 --> 20:57.290
Under the order
of the Governor, Lord Jiang,

20:57.310 --> 20:59.400
we're on this mountain to capture bandits.

20:59.400 --> 21:02.160
Anyone who dares to resist
will be killed on the spot!

21:02.160 --> 21:02.830
Stop it!

21:06.750 --> 21:07.560
Who are you?

21:07.590 --> 21:09.270
Which commander are you under?

21:09.270 --> 21:11.240
You're insolent and unscrupulous.

21:11.240 --> 21:13.200
How dare you make trouble
in Rong's Plantation?

21:13.200 --> 21:14.670
Don't try to touch anything agian!

21:14.670 --> 21:15.620
You're openly

21:15.640 --> 21:17.080
defying our search.

21:17.400 --> 21:19.000
Do you want to harbor the criminals

21:19.000 --> 21:20.540
and engage in illegal activities?

21:20.540 --> 21:22.430
Guards! Arrest them!

21:23.350 --> 21:24.720
You're talking nonsense!

21:24.720 --> 21:26.110
The Rong Mansion was robbed.

21:26.110 --> 21:27.070
In this world, no victim

21:27.070 --> 21:28.480
would harbor the bandits.

21:28.480 --> 21:29.790
You know this is Rong's Plantation,

21:29.790 --> 21:31.720
but you still dare to barge in  here.

21:31.720 --> 21:33.380
Do you have ulterior motives?

21:33.640 --> 21:34.370
Arrest them!

21:34.590 --> 21:35.110
Yi.

21:42.010 --> 21:43.870
I'd like to see which of you dares.

21:45.480 --> 21:47.410
Just see what's beneath your feet.

21:47.510 --> 21:49.310
Those tea leaves beneath your feet

21:49.310 --> 21:50.310
are the top-grade

21:50.480 --> 21:51.550
Cold Dew Tea Leaves that will be delivered

21:51.550 --> 21:53.150
to the capital in seven days.

21:53.400 --> 21:54.750
They're only harvested three days before

21:54.750 --> 21:56.070
and four days after the Cold Dew Day.

21:56.070 --> 21:58.310
The harvest is only conducted
during these seven days each year.

21:58.310 --> 21:58.960
In the entire world,

21:58.960 --> 22:00.790
they're only grown on this mountain.

22:00.790 --> 22:03.070
Even one liang of them
is extremely valuable.

22:03.070 --> 22:05.070
When the imperial family
punishes people for this,

22:05.070 --> 22:06.440
can your head

22:06.680 --> 22:08.610
and the lives of your entire family

22:08.830 --> 22:09.720
be kept safe?

22:11.440 --> 22:13.550
Destroying imperial tea leaves
is an unforgivable crime.

22:13.550 --> 22:15.930
There must be someone
taking responsibility for this crime.

22:15.930 --> 22:19.190
Are you guys willing to
share the responsibility with him?

22:23.070 --> 22:24.720
I didn't know
these were imperial tea leaves!

22:24.720 --> 22:27.120
I was just following orders
to take action!

22:42.960 --> 22:43.920
Please let us go!

22:43.920 --> 22:45.030
I'm begging you!

22:47.070 --> 22:48.830
My Lord, we're not bandits!

22:49.510 --> 22:50.240
My Lord!

22:50.680 --> 22:51.920
We're not bandits!

22:52.310 --> 22:52.960
My Lord!

22:57.960 --> 23:00.240
The Rong family has always been patriotic
and loyal to the monarch.

23:00.240 --> 23:01.680
We once donated
several million taels of platinum

23:01.680 --> 23:03.030
for the border warfare

23:03.550 --> 23:05.510
and even tirelessly helped to
transport military provisions.

23:05.510 --> 23:08.070
Everyone in the imperial court
admired and respected us.

23:08.070 --> 23:09.310
The late Emperor bestowed the title

23:09.310 --> 23:10.550
of Madam Anguo on my grandmother.

23:10.550 --> 23:12.350
She can submit confidential memorials
directly to His Majesty.

23:12.350 --> 23:13.550
What an honor that is!

23:13.720 --> 23:15.180
The Rong family's loyalty

23:15.240 --> 23:17.370
has long been recognized
by His Majesty's great insight.

23:17.370 --> 23:19.590
Are the bandits hiding
in the tea plantation or not?

23:19.590 --> 23:21.320
Did you see that clearly or not?

23:22.480 --> 23:24.340
The Provincial Governor is here!

23:27.070 --> 23:29.670
I'm Zhang Zhong.
Greetings, Your Excellency.

23:35.200 --> 23:37.930
A gang of notorious bandits
has entered the city.

23:38.030 --> 23:41.270
They robbed innocent households.
Their crimes are unforgivable.

23:41.270 --> 23:43.160
As the official in charge of this region,

23:43.160 --> 23:44.890
I have a heavy responsibility.

23:44.960 --> 23:47.400
I will not allow the bandits
to get rampant

23:47.880 --> 23:49.640
and disturb the peace of our citizens.

23:49.640 --> 23:51.110
When I find out

23:51.440 --> 23:53.840
who secretly
helped these bandits escape,

23:54.030 --> 23:56.680
I will treat him as an accomplice.

23:57.720 --> 23:59.720
Zhang Zhong, search this place now!

23:59.880 --> 24:00.400
Search!

24:06.310 --> 24:06.960
Shanbao.

24:07.440 --> 24:09.300
We can't let them act so absurdly!

24:09.480 --> 24:11.140
Since we have nothing to hide,

24:11.270 --> 24:12.720
what is there they cannot search?

24:12.720 --> 24:14.320
Let them search as they wish.

24:14.720 --> 24:16.350
I also want to see

24:16.720 --> 24:18.680
what Lord Jiang can possibly find.

24:21.550 --> 24:23.550
Over here! Quickly! Search! Hurry!

24:26.640 --> 24:27.300
Over there!

24:43.030 --> 24:43.750
Take it away!

24:43.750 --> 24:44.410
-Yes!
-Yes!

24:53.350 --> 24:55.160
My Lord, we found it.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.350
Shanbao, well...

25:09.310 --> 25:09.960
Shanbao.

25:10.880 --> 25:13.080
This is Grandmother's treasured item.

25:13.960 --> 25:14.760
Take her away!

25:16.190 --> 25:16.740
Wait!

25:24.920 --> 25:25.720
Rong Shanbao.

25:26.680 --> 25:27.350
I even vouched for you

25:27.350 --> 25:28.440
in front of

25:28.440 --> 25:29.590
the Provincial Governor.

25:29.590 --> 25:30.310
I can't believe you didn't even know

25:30.310 --> 25:31.480
your own tea plantation had become

25:31.480 --> 25:33.000
the place of hiding stolen goods.

25:33.000 --> 25:34.930
How could you be so muddle-headed?

25:38.940 --> 25:41.000
Lord Lu, you are mistaken about that.

25:41.350 --> 25:43.100
I was expelled from the Rong family
by my grandmother,

25:43.100 --> 25:44.640
which has long been known to all.

25:44.640 --> 25:46.300
While my grandmother was ill,

25:46.590 --> 25:48.240
by using the secret tunnel
in the Hualin Courtyard

25:48.240 --> 25:50.110
to collude with bandits from outside,

25:50.110 --> 25:52.310
firstly, this person could
increase his personal wealth,

25:52.310 --> 25:54.710
and secondly, he could warn my grandmother

25:54.830 --> 25:55.890
to make her realize

25:56.310 --> 25:59.310
that the household cannot be
without a person in charge,

25:59.310 --> 26:01.240
so she would summon me back sooner.

26:01.270 --> 26:02.070
Rong Shanbao!

26:03.200 --> 26:05.000
I suppose if you search further,

26:05.070 --> 26:06.880
you'll find even more evidence against me.

26:06.880 --> 26:09.640
As people say, when someone wants to
condemn you, he can always find a reason.

26:09.640 --> 26:11.510
If Lord Jiang insists that I'm guilty,

26:11.510 --> 26:12.840
whether I admit it or not

26:12.880 --> 26:14.080
just doesn't matter.

26:14.790 --> 26:16.640
Alright. If you admit it,

26:17.270 --> 26:19.070
that would be good for everyone.

26:19.070 --> 26:19.720
Guards!

26:19.720 --> 26:20.400
Guards!

26:22.200 --> 26:24.130
Arrest Rong Shanbao immediately!

26:25.640 --> 26:27.880
Lord Lu, what do you mean by doing this?

26:29.750 --> 26:31.160
My Lord, please calm down.

26:31.160 --> 26:32.790
My Lord,
you've sent so many soldiers here today

26:32.790 --> 26:34.360
to search the entire mountain.

26:34.360 --> 26:36.310
Are you trying to find the bandits here?

26:36.310 --> 26:38.570
Don't pretend you don't know the answer.

26:51.720 --> 26:52.550
May I ask

26:53.550 --> 26:54.960
what the value of this item is?

26:54.960 --> 26:56.620
It's worth 300 taels at least.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.530
What about this one?

26:58.640 --> 27:00.640
It's worth no less than 1,000 taels.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.200
My Lord.

27:06.000 --> 27:07.240
According to our dynasty's laws,

27:07.240 --> 27:08.960
if a robbery case occurs in a region

27:08.960 --> 27:10.270
and the stolen silver exceeds 5,000 taels,

27:10.270 --> 27:12.000
it counts as a major case that must be

27:12.000 --> 27:14.160
reported to the Ministry of Justice
and His Majesty.

27:14.160 --> 27:15.630
All officials of prefectures and counties,

27:15.630 --> 27:16.610
including myself

27:16.610 --> 27:17.810
and even you, My Lord,

27:17.920 --> 27:19.550
will be held accountable
for negligence on precautions.

27:19.550 --> 27:20.750
With the slightest incaution,

27:20.750 --> 27:23.400
we would face impeachment
from the imperial censors.

27:23.400 --> 27:25.200
What would you suggest, Lord Lu?

27:30.160 --> 27:32.750
If Lady Rong Shanbao is put into prison
to wait for her conviction,

27:32.750 --> 27:34.550
and you personally
conduct the interrogation,

27:34.550 --> 27:36.240
everyone in Linji will feel insecure,

27:36.240 --> 27:37.830
which will definitely cause panic
all over the city.

27:37.830 --> 27:40.070
That's harmful
for your reputation as an official.

27:40.070 --> 27:42.510
Why not let me investigate the case?

27:43.240 --> 27:45.030
Whether she's hiding stolen goods
or being falsely accused,

27:45.030 --> 27:46.170
we'd better find the bandits first

27:46.170 --> 27:48.170
before deciding on the conviction.

27:56.790 --> 27:57.360
Alright.

27:58.160 --> 28:00.720
Lord Lu, since you're volunteering,

28:01.270 --> 28:02.200
then this case

28:02.400 --> 28:03.800
will be entrusted to you.

28:04.180 --> 28:04.860
However,

28:05.030 --> 28:06.430
if an official
is assigned to handle a case

28:06.430 --> 28:07.230
and fails to

28:07.260 --> 28:09.190
arrest the bandits within 10 days,

28:09.720 --> 28:12.200
he'll be sentenced to 40 lashes
and be dismissed from his post.

28:12.200 --> 28:12.880
Lord Lu,

28:13.480 --> 28:15.210
can you bear this consequence?

28:15.680 --> 28:18.110
I won't let you down, My Lord.

28:19.220 --> 28:19.830
Guards!

28:20.200 --> 28:23.330
Take all the stolen goods back
to the County Office, too!

28:36.750 --> 28:37.810
Lady Rong Shanbao.

28:38.350 --> 28:39.440
Everything in the prison
is simple and crude,

28:39.440 --> 28:41.100
but this is kind of a good cell.

28:41.270 --> 28:42.440
Sorry for the inconvenience.

28:42.440 --> 28:43.840
Please stay in this cell.

28:45.790 --> 28:46.440
It's fine.

28:50.000 --> 28:51.330
If you need anything...

28:51.680 --> 28:52.200
Rong Shanbao!

28:52.200 --> 28:53.000
-What exactly are you trying to do?
-My Lord!

28:53.000 --> 28:54.350
As the presiding judge,
you must avoid any suspicion.

28:54.350 --> 28:55.280
Get out of my way!

28:56.070 --> 28:57.470
I just don't understand.

28:57.590 --> 28:59.070
You knew someone had tampered
with the tea plantation,

28:59.070 --> 29:00.830
but you didn't even say a word
to defend yourself.

29:00.830 --> 29:01.270
Do you have any idea

29:01.270 --> 29:02.270
what a prison is like?

29:02.270 --> 29:03.680
Do you think it's like the backyard
of your Rong Mansion?

29:03.680 --> 29:05.160
If you had been sent
to the Provincial Governor's Office,

29:05.160 --> 29:05.920
how could Jiang Yiqian possibly let you

29:05.920 --> 29:06.680
get out alive?

29:06.680 --> 29:07.510
He thinks of the Rong family

29:07.510 --> 29:08.480
as a thorn in his flesh

29:08.480 --> 29:10.480
and has long wanted to deal with you.

29:11.510 --> 29:12.970
Aren't you quite capable?

29:13.060 --> 29:13.850
Answer me!

29:14.070 --> 29:15.530
Please calm down, My Lord.

29:15.960 --> 29:16.760
Rong Shanbao!

29:17.110 --> 29:18.240
Are you deaf or mute?

29:24.070 --> 29:25.800
Aren't you here for me, My Lord?

29:32.200 --> 29:33.550
Lord Lu, you're upright, impartial,

29:33.550 --> 29:35.080
resourceful and decisive.

29:35.160 --> 29:37.270
You redressed the injustice
in the Wei family's case.

29:37.270 --> 29:39.640
There are few officials
as righteous as you in this world.

29:39.640 --> 29:41.790
I believe
you can distinguish right from wrong,

29:41.790 --> 29:42.750
bringing justice for an innocent person

29:42.750 --> 29:43.510
like me.

29:48.160 --> 29:49.480
My Lord! My Lord!

30:00.880 --> 30:04.310
It's easy to invite the devil in,
but it's hard to make him leave.

30:04.310 --> 30:05.110
Lord Jiang.

30:06.070 --> 30:08.330
You've asked for this trouble yourself.

30:08.570 --> 30:09.630
You can't blame me.

30:16.480 --> 30:18.210
Grandmother refuses to see us?

30:18.330 --> 30:19.710
We're here to visit her while she's sick.

30:19.710 --> 30:21.910
Why would Grandmother avoid seeing us?

30:28.820 --> 30:30.350
My dear sisters, you're here.

30:30.350 --> 30:30.960
Yunshu.

30:31.240 --> 30:32.610
Do you know
the officials found the stolen goods

30:32.610 --> 30:33.400
in the tea plantation,

30:33.400 --> 30:34.550
falsely accused Lady Shanbao
of being the ringleader

30:34.550 --> 30:35.550
and took her away?

30:35.640 --> 30:37.550
This matter concerns the century-old
reputation of the Rong family.

30:37.550 --> 30:38.550
It's extremely serious.

30:38.550 --> 30:39.550
Just let me in now.

30:39.640 --> 30:41.160
I need to report it to Grandmother.

30:41.160 --> 30:41.990
Xiangling.

30:42.300 --> 30:44.100
You know Grandmother's temper.

30:44.280 --> 30:46.030
She hates those who are blinded
by affections,

30:46.030 --> 30:48.090
unfilial, rebellious and disloyal.

30:48.400 --> 30:50.070
A person with all those traits

30:50.440 --> 30:52.440
can never return to the Rong family.

30:52.440 --> 30:54.280
The lessons learnt from the past
are still so vivid in our mind.

30:54.280 --> 30:56.200
Others may be too foolish
to understand the situation.

30:56.200 --> 30:57.720
Do you also not understand, Xiangling?

30:57.720 --> 30:58.160
You...

30:59.890 --> 31:00.650
Yunshu.

31:01.110 --> 31:02.880
We are all Grandmother's granddaughters

31:02.880 --> 31:04.750
and should take care of her
while she's sick.

31:04.750 --> 31:07.030
How could we let you
bear this burden alone?

31:07.030 --> 31:09.420
Besides, your own wound hasn't healed yet.

31:09.420 --> 31:10.820
If you exhaust yourself,

31:10.880 --> 31:12.880
it'll be harder for your injury to heal.

31:12.880 --> 31:13.790
Yes, indeed.

31:14.200 --> 31:15.510
Yunshu, you're such a delicate person,

31:15.510 --> 31:17.110
but you still protected Grandmother
from the knife attack.

31:17.110 --> 31:18.790
Your filial piety
can even move Heaven and Earth.

31:18.790 --> 31:20.640
No one can take that merit away from you.

31:20.640 --> 31:22.270
Just go back to recuperate
and don't worry.

31:22.270 --> 31:23.480
We sisters can take turns
to look after Grandmother,

31:23.480 --> 31:24.640
which is the proper way.

31:24.640 --> 31:27.300
It's just a minor injury
and is nothing serious.

31:27.750 --> 31:29.790
I know you all are concerned
about Grandmother.

31:29.790 --> 31:31.790
She will appreciate your filial devotion.

31:31.790 --> 31:33.720
But Grandmother is being sick now.

31:33.790 --> 31:35.790
She's not only unable to
walk normally as usual

31:35.790 --> 31:38.120
but also incapable of speaking properly.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.200
Grandmother is a woman

31:39.200 --> 31:40.510
of indomitable will.

31:40.890 --> 31:42.060
She would never want anyone to see her

31:42.060 --> 31:43.590
moving her limbs clumsily.

31:43.720 --> 31:45.630
If you all insist on barging in,

31:46.230 --> 31:47.640
which might irritate Grandmother,

31:47.640 --> 31:48.960
I can't bear the consequences.

31:48.960 --> 31:50.090
I insist on going in.

31:50.160 --> 31:51.490
What can you do about it?

31:52.030 --> 31:52.640
Get lost!

31:53.880 --> 31:55.280
Tell them all to get lost!

32:01.160 --> 32:02.360
Did you all hear that?

32:02.480 --> 32:03.510
Please leave now.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.640
Look! How authoritative

32:05.640 --> 32:06.840
Lady Yunshu is today.

32:07.240 --> 32:08.110
Is she still

32:08.680 --> 32:09.550
your sweet and fragile fiancée

32:09.550 --> 32:11.150
who's as delicate as dodder?

32:12.350 --> 32:13.550
She's strong-willed

32:14.110 --> 32:15.570
with formidable tactics.

32:15.880 --> 32:18.440
How would she still need
anyone's protection?

32:18.440 --> 32:19.030
How long

32:19.030 --> 32:20.960
will you keep deceiving yourself?

32:31.480 --> 32:32.310
This is a safety amulet

32:32.310 --> 32:33.570
I got for Grandmother.

32:34.000 --> 32:35.730
Being placed under her pillow,

32:35.790 --> 32:37.680
it can calm her spirit and ward off evil.

32:37.680 --> 32:38.400
People say in the capital,

32:38.400 --> 32:40.160
there's an imperial physician
surnamed Hou,

32:40.160 --> 32:41.550
whose ancestral wind-drawing decoction

32:41.550 --> 32:43.790
has miraculous effects
on calming the liver and dispelling wind.

32:43.790 --> 32:45.390
I've already asked someone
to invite him here.

32:45.390 --> 32:46.990
He will arrive in Linji soon.

32:47.360 --> 32:49.760
I'll come here
to greet her again tomorrow.

32:52.110 --> 32:54.040
Yunshu, thanks for your hard work.

32:55.000 --> 32:56.000
Bye, Yunxi.

33:02.200 --> 33:03.590
Yunshu, you're so smart

33:03.590 --> 33:04.650
and quick-witted,

33:04.680 --> 33:06.640
being the most outstanding one
among all the sisters.

33:06.640 --> 33:08.830
I always knew you would
achieve a position like this today.

33:08.830 --> 33:09.640
Don't worry.

33:09.910 --> 33:11.270
I'm not on their side.

33:11.700 --> 33:12.640
Currently, you've been

33:12.640 --> 33:14.270
staying by Grandmother's side every day.

33:14.270 --> 33:16.160
There are so many trivial matters
that you can hardly attend to everything.

33:16.160 --> 33:17.690
I may not have other skills,

33:17.960 --> 33:19.750
but I'm qutie good at
handling household affairs.

33:19.750 --> 33:21.160
If there's anything bothering you,

33:21.160 --> 33:22.360
just tell me, Yunshu.

33:22.510 --> 33:24.440
I won't refuse to help.

33:27.550 --> 33:29.280
I know you care about me, Yun'e.

33:29.440 --> 33:30.880
Thank you for that.

33:36.480 --> 33:38.480
I'll come talk to you again tonight.

33:41.640 --> 33:42.680
You usually don't like

33:42.680 --> 33:43.810
this fence-sitter.

33:44.510 --> 33:46.400
In the past, she could side with Yunxi,

33:46.400 --> 33:47.930
and now she can defect to me.

33:48.320 --> 33:49.320
Doesn't this show

33:49.340 --> 33:50.960
the trend of popular sentiment
in the mansion?

33:50.960 --> 33:52.920
After all, now I am

33:52.920 --> 33:54.590
Grandmother's most trusted granddaughter.

33:54.590 --> 33:55.320
Come with me.

34:08.429 --> 34:09.150
Shixin.

34:10.110 --> 34:11.239
From today onwards,

34:11.760 --> 34:12.320
help me keep an eye on

34:12.320 --> 34:14.050
Lady Yunshu's every movement.

34:14.550 --> 34:16.880
Young Master, are you suspecting her?

34:17.550 --> 34:19.480
Lady Shanbao is not in the mansion.

34:19.710 --> 34:20.590
I have to help her guard against

34:20.590 --> 34:22.120
those with ill intentions.

34:22.590 --> 34:24.690
Lady Yunshu's behavior is suspicious.

34:24.690 --> 34:25.889
We must be wary of her.

34:33.590 --> 34:34.510
It hurts.

34:34.760 --> 34:36.550
Why are you confining Old Madam?

34:36.550 --> 34:38.030
Grandmother refuses to see outsiders.

34:38.030 --> 34:40.000
How can a younger member
like me dissuade her?

34:40.000 --> 34:40.800
As your fiancée,

34:40.800 --> 34:41.960
I've just escaped death,

34:41.960 --> 34:44.190
and despite my illness,
I have to deal with all the affairs,

34:44.190 --> 34:45.719
but you've shown no concern

34:45.760 --> 34:47.290
and are blaming me instead.

34:47.960 --> 34:49.840
Bai, go back and think carefully.

34:50.400 --> 34:51.880
If you still don't understand,

34:51.880 --> 34:53.340
don't come to see me again.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.409
Rumor has it that

34:56.590 --> 34:57.440
back then, Old Madam

34:57.440 --> 35:00.300
asked Third Master Rong
to escort the tea products.

35:00.710 --> 35:02.280
As soon as the tea caravan left the city,

35:02.280 --> 35:04.030
Old Madam
drove your mother away immediately,

35:04.030 --> 35:05.030
causing her to freeze to death
in severe winter

35:05.030 --> 35:06.150
in the Mountain God Temple.

35:06.150 --> 35:08.320
There was even no simple coffin
for her burial.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.230
When Third Master Rong got the news,

35:09.230 --> 35:10.480
he rushed back desperately

35:10.480 --> 35:12.210
and rode three horses to death,

35:12.280 --> 35:14.480
but he still couldn't make it
for his wife's funeral.

35:14.480 --> 35:16.210
He resented Old Madam so deeply

35:16.440 --> 35:19.500
that he built a hut
beside his wife's grave to live there

35:19.710 --> 35:21.710
and spent his days drinking.

35:22.440 --> 35:24.970
He passed away in despair
within three years.

35:25.230 --> 35:26.070
You hate Old Madam

35:26.070 --> 35:28.360
for having belittled and mistreated you
since childhood.

35:28.360 --> 35:30.840
You intend to seize control
of the Rong family.

35:30.840 --> 35:33.760
It was you who framed Rong Shanbao.

35:34.360 --> 35:35.480
Those bandits were also...

35:35.480 --> 35:36.110
Shut up!

35:45.800 --> 35:46.880
It was really you.

35:53.400 --> 35:55.480
That's just some gossip on the street.

35:55.480 --> 35:56.880
Don't take it seriously.

35:57.280 --> 35:57.920
Bai.

35:58.030 --> 35:59.510
You promised to help me,

35:59.670 --> 36:02.070
but now you're suspicious of me
in every way.

36:02.070 --> 36:03.600
I'm so disappointed in you.

36:04.710 --> 36:08.510
If I had known this would happen,
I wouldn't have done that back then.

36:08.630 --> 36:09.230
Yunshu.

36:10.960 --> 36:12.880
I was planning to go to the capital
for the examination next month,

36:12.880 --> 36:14.670
but now it looks like
I need to leave earlier.

36:14.670 --> 36:15.590
Just leave with me

36:15.590 --> 36:16.800
in three days.

36:18.710 --> 36:19.640
What did you say?

36:19.880 --> 36:20.840
Despite your silver tongue

36:20.840 --> 36:21.960
and solemn promises,

36:21.960 --> 36:23.710
I have eyes and can judge for myself.

36:23.710 --> 36:24.590
I cannot stand by,

36:24.590 --> 36:26.480
watching you sink deeper into this mire.

36:26.480 --> 36:29.280
Either you come with me to the capital,

36:30.550 --> 36:32.810
and then we can put everything behind us,

36:33.150 --> 36:35.320
or I will expose everything

36:35.320 --> 36:36.480
you've done

36:37.480 --> 36:41.240
one by one in front of the people.

36:55.900 --> 36:58.490
Bai Yingsheng, I hate you!

37:03.280 --> 37:04.610
Just hate me as you wish.

37:05.480 --> 37:06.680
See you in three days.

37:15.720 --> 37:17.370
[Provincial Governor's Office]

37:16.960 --> 37:18.710
My Lord,
we've searched the entire tea mountain.

37:18.710 --> 37:20.030
Except for some stolen goods,

37:20.030 --> 37:20.880
we still haven't found

37:20.880 --> 37:22.340
any traces of the bandits.

37:23.480 --> 37:24.190
Scribe Liu.

37:27.550 --> 37:28.190
My Lord.

37:28.880 --> 37:30.960
You've worked for me for so many years.

37:30.960 --> 37:31.710
Tell me.

37:32.920 --> 37:34.800
In my report to His Majesty,

37:35.440 --> 37:37.190
what crime should I
charge Lu Jianglai with?

37:37.190 --> 37:38.630
Here's my answer, My Lord.

37:38.630 --> 37:41.110
Rong Shanbao
is the main culprit in this case,

37:41.110 --> 37:42.630
and the stolen goods have been found, too.

37:42.630 --> 37:45.590
However, the newly appointed
Prefect of Linji, Lu Jianglai,

37:45.590 --> 37:48.670
has a personal relationship with her
and deliberately shields her.

37:48.670 --> 37:50.000
My Lord, in this report,

37:50.190 --> 37:52.770
you should accuse him
of perverting the law for personal favor

37:52.770 --> 37:54.770
and betraying His Majesty's trust.

37:57.760 --> 37:58.760
My Lord, no wonder that day,

37:58.760 --> 38:00.550
you allowed him to leave so easily.

38:00.550 --> 38:01.280
This is already

38:01.280 --> 38:03.190
irrefutable evidence of his crime.

38:03.190 --> 38:04.520
My Lord, you're so wise.

38:04.960 --> 38:06.210
You just said

38:06.440 --> 38:07.960
you didn't see

38:07.960 --> 38:10.030
any traces of the bandits on the mountain.

38:10.030 --> 38:10.960
In my opinion,

38:12.070 --> 38:13.600
that shouldn't be the case.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.400
I am foolish, sir.

38:16.440 --> 38:17.110
Probably,

38:17.190 --> 38:18.760
our search wasn't thorough enough.

38:18.760 --> 38:20.480
There are thousands of tea farmers
on this tea mountain.

38:20.480 --> 38:21.070
Hiding among them

38:21.070 --> 38:22.470
would be extremely easy.

38:22.590 --> 38:23.920
Please let me go check it out again.

38:23.920 --> 38:25.580
I will definitely capture the bandits.

38:25.580 --> 38:26.270
Go now.

38:26.440 --> 38:26.960
Yes!

38:28.320 --> 38:29.360
I'm leaving.

38:35.920 --> 38:36.440
Go!

38:37.690 --> 38:39.490
Behave yourself! Go over there!

38:39.710 --> 38:40.880
Don't arrest me!

38:42.800 --> 38:44.530
On what grounds can you do this?

38:45.230 --> 38:45.960
Go now!

38:47.880 --> 38:48.540
Don't move!

38:48.710 --> 38:49.920
On what grounds can you do this?

38:49.920 --> 38:51.070
I'm innocent!

38:51.320 --> 38:52.590
That's right!
On what grounds can you arrest us?

38:52.590 --> 38:53.590
Except for tea leaves,

38:53.590 --> 38:54.670
how could there be bandits
on the mountain?

38:54.670 --> 38:57.280
On what grounds
can you arrest people arbitrarily?

38:57.280 --> 38:59.810
If you keep nagging,
you'll be arrested, too.

39:00.110 --> 39:00.480
Let's go!

39:00.480 --> 39:02.230
What crimes have we committed?

39:02.590 --> 39:03.670
-Why are you arresting me?
-Hurry up!

39:03.670 --> 39:04.280
Go!

39:04.280 --> 39:05.190
We're honest people.

39:05.190 --> 39:06.480
Please release us now!

39:06.920 --> 39:07.510
Go!

39:10.150 --> 39:11.010
Miss Xiu Qiong.

39:11.190 --> 39:11.840
Most of them

39:11.840 --> 39:13.110
have traveled far from their hometowns

39:13.110 --> 39:14.070
to make a living here.

39:14.070 --> 39:16.030
They know nothing
except growing tea leaves!

39:16.030 --> 39:16.630
Most of them

39:16.630 --> 39:18.020
have never even left the tea mountain.

39:18.020 --> 39:19.550
How could they possibly be bandits?

39:19.550 --> 39:20.410
Miss Xiu Qiong,

39:20.470 --> 39:22.130
please find a way to save them!

39:23.590 --> 39:24.590
But now, even Lady Shanbao

39:24.590 --> 39:25.480
is in prison herself,

39:25.480 --> 39:27.440
being unable to get rid of the trouble.

39:27.440 --> 39:28.640
I'm just a lowly maid.

39:29.070 --> 39:31.070
What solutions can I possibly have?

39:40.630 --> 39:41.110
Tell me!

39:42.390 --> 39:44.050
I'm not a bandit!

39:44.800 --> 39:46.400
You're asking for a beating!

39:47.360 --> 39:49.220
Officer, I'm really not a bandit!

39:49.960 --> 39:51.030
Where are you from?

39:52.000 --> 39:53.060
I'm talking to you!

39:53.550 --> 39:54.030
I'm...

39:54.710 --> 39:55.970
I'm from the mountain.

39:56.310 --> 39:58.030
My elder sister
came to work for Lady Shanbao,

39:58.030 --> 39:59.290
so I came with her, too.

39:59.590 --> 40:02.250
Lady Shanbao taught us
how to process tea leaves

40:02.510 --> 40:03.510
and gave us food.

40:05.190 --> 40:07.250
There are no free meals in this world.

40:07.880 --> 40:09.630
You're saying Lady Rong Shanbao

40:09.630 --> 40:11.630
taught you guys how to process tea leaves

40:11.630 --> 40:12.840
and hired martial artists

40:12.840 --> 40:14.190
to teach you fighting skills.

40:14.190 --> 40:15.850
What exactly was her purpose?

40:17.150 --> 40:18.150
Lady Shanbao said

40:18.320 --> 40:20.450
by learning some martial arts skills,

40:20.480 --> 40:21.320
in the future...

40:21.320 --> 40:23.070
in the future,
while following tea caravans outside,

40:23.070 --> 40:24.730
we would get triple the wages.

40:25.630 --> 40:27.290
How come I don't believe that?

40:33.070 --> 40:35.400
She kept private guards
in the tea plantation.

40:35.400 --> 40:37.200
She must be plotting something.

40:37.390 --> 40:40.100
Tell me! Were you the one

40:40.840 --> 40:42.440
who robbed the Rong Mansion?

40:42.440 --> 40:43.030
No.

40:43.320 --> 40:44.280
Not you, huh?

40:44.510 --> 40:45.860
Then tell me who it was.

40:47.510 --> 40:48.400
Was it him?

40:49.400 --> 40:50.470
Or him?

40:50.920 --> 40:51.480
I'm innocent!

40:51.480 --> 40:52.320
Or him?

40:56.030 --> 40:57.360
If it was not him,

40:57.440 --> 40:58.500
then it must be you!

41:06.400 --> 41:07.510
It was him.

41:11.480 --> 41:12.320
What a coward.

41:16.230 --> 41:17.840
Boy, you're kind of honest.

41:18.760 --> 41:20.840
It's just that you're a bit inarticulate.

41:20.840 --> 41:21.670
Take him away.

41:22.320 --> 41:25.030
Teach him how to speak properly.

41:26.920 --> 41:27.360
Go!

41:29.400 --> 41:30.000
My Lord.

41:30.230 --> 41:31.510
The evidence of keep private soldiers...

41:31.510 --> 41:32.150
Idiot!

41:32.590 --> 41:33.670
If the Provincial Governor says
there is such evidence,

41:33.670 --> 41:35.000
then there must be some.

41:35.400 --> 41:38.130
As for those bandits
who are hiding somewhere...

41:39.150 --> 41:41.030
Aren't these all of them?

41:43.070 --> 41:43.630
Yes.

41:46.010 --> 41:51.400
[Rong Mansion]

41:48.830 --> 41:49.890
-My Lady!
-My Lady!

41:50.480 --> 41:51.800
I'm Lady Yunyin from the Rong Mansion.

41:51.800 --> 41:52.710
I need to see Grandmother.

41:52.710 --> 41:53.710
How dare you stop me?

41:53.710 --> 41:54.280
Step aside!

41:54.280 --> 41:55.550
We're just following orders to do this.

41:55.550 --> 41:56.510
Please understand this, Lady Yunyin.

41:56.510 --> 41:58.510
Don't make things difficult for us.

41:58.630 --> 42:00.490
Following orders? Whose orders?

42:00.840 --> 42:01.590
When did the Rong family

42:01.590 --> 42:02.520
get a new master?

42:02.940 --> 42:04.190
All of you, get out of my way!

42:04.190 --> 42:06.720
Who's making such noise
outside the mansion?

42:07.920 --> 42:09.280
So it's you, Yunyin?

42:10.000 --> 42:11.480
Yun'e, I need to see Grandmother.

42:11.480 --> 42:12.740
Help me inform her now.

42:13.000 --> 42:13.880
Have you forgotten

42:13.880 --> 42:15.280
what you did previously?

42:15.280 --> 42:17.670
I'm afraid
Grandmother doesn't want to see you.

42:17.670 --> 42:19.230
There are orders from the Chongxi Hall.

42:19.230 --> 42:20.910
Grandmother
needs to stay indoors and rest quietly.

42:20.910 --> 42:22.800
She won't see any external visitors.

42:22.800 --> 42:24.200
What are you waiting for?

42:24.510 --> 42:25.030
Come on.

42:26.150 --> 42:28.070
Rong Yun'e, how dare you!

42:28.490 --> 42:30.510
I am also Grandmother's granddaughter.

42:30.510 --> 42:31.640
Insolent servants!

42:31.710 --> 42:33.240
Who allowed you to touch me?

42:33.270 --> 42:35.090
Evne Grandmother's once favorite
granddaughter

42:35.090 --> 42:36.460
is imprisoned now,

42:36.630 --> 42:37.590
but she hasn't

42:37.590 --> 42:38.850
asked about her at all.

42:38.920 --> 42:41.800
Times have changed,
and everything is different now.

42:41.800 --> 42:42.800
Only your own sister

42:42.800 --> 42:44.360
still lets you maintain your bad temper.

42:44.360 --> 42:46.760
Nowadays,
who else would have time for you?

42:47.230 --> 42:48.090
Close the door.

43:01.280 --> 43:02.080
Grandmother!

43:02.710 --> 43:04.590
Are you going to ignore Shanbao too?

43:04.590 --> 43:06.360
Shanbao has been framed!

43:06.800 --> 43:07.670
Grandmother!

43:08.150 --> 43:09.110
Grandmother!

45:47.390 --> 45:49.750
[Grandmaster of Tea]

45:51.880 --> 45:52.680
Wanwan, look.

45:53.960 --> 45:55.110
You must do it this way,

45:55.110 --> 45:56.960
flipping them up
with your thenar eminence.

45:56.960 --> 45:59.220
In this way, you won't get burned easily.

45:59.420 --> 46:01.760
Grandmasters of Tea in the Ming Dynasty
weren't scholars.

46:01.760 --> 46:03.590
They were teahouse waiters

46:03.670 --> 46:05.360
who were proficient in tea arts.

46:05.360 --> 46:06.840
They were commonly found in teahouses

46:06.840 --> 46:08.000
and scholarly gatherings.

46:08.000 --> 46:09.230
Grandmasters of Tea excelled at

46:09.230 --> 46:11.650
evaluating tea, selecting water
and controlling the boiling state.

46:11.650 --> 46:14.080
They were especially adept at
brewing loose tea.

46:14.080 --> 46:15.230
They could match different tea varieties

46:15.230 --> 46:17.610
with appropriate purple-clay teapots
or blue-and-white cups.

46:17.610 --> 46:19.510
Grandmasters of Tea
were not only skilled in tea arts

46:19.510 --> 46:20.670
but also refined in speech and manner.

46:20.670 --> 46:21.600
While brewing tea,

46:21.600 --> 46:23.400
they could even turn it
into a performance.

46:23.400 --> 46:25.440
Teahouses flourished in the Ming Dynasty.

46:25.440 --> 46:27.730
Grandmasters of Tea
earned handsome incomes.

46:27.730 --> 46:29.230
They were both service providers

46:29.230 --> 46:30.960
and inheritors of tea traditions,

46:30.960 --> 46:33.480
known as the prototypes
of modern tea artists.
